<article class="track">
  <h3 class="track__title">The keyboard player</h3>
  <p class="track__note">
    A pioneer. Before anyone gave cats a stage, this one took a seat
    at the keys and played in public, with composure, to people who
    were not yet ready. The scene owes a great deal to that. The
    Founder does not speak of the early years of the keyboard, and the
    silence is a mark of respect.
  </p>
